{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Uttiya (1st)","html":"<article id='thag1.30'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.30 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.30 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Uttiyattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Uttiya (1st) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Ābādhe me samuppanne, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>When I was ill in the past, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sati me udapajjatha; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>mindfulness arose in me. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ābādho me samuppanno, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Now I am ill once more—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kālo me nappamajjitun”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>it’s time for me to be heedful. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Uttiyo thero … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>vaggo tatiyo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nigrodho cittako thero, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>gosālathero sugandho; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nandiyo abhayo thero, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>thero lomasakaṅgiyo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Jambugāmikaputto ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>hārito uttiyo isīti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
